    "title": "Painting approach",
    "items": [
     {
      "t": "Out of the dark",
      "d": "Her oils begin on a deep dark ground. One pale form is brought up out of the shadow, and the rest is left quiet."
     },
     {
      "t": "From life",
      "d": "Roses and hibiscus are painted in watercolour straight from life, looking at the real flower."
     },
     {
      "t": "Drawing first",
